    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπρόσθ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fore</i>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσθιος</span>
			, of the feet of a quadruped, opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπίσθιοι, ἐ. πόδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.60
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					11.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				688a12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				35.286
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					687b28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐ. ὀδόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					198b25
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τραύμ́ατα</span> wounds <i>in
				front</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				10.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astron.,
				<i>preceding</i> in the daily motion of the heavens, <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				1.1
			</span></i>.</div>
